{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕張で個別握手会！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"服は〜こんな感じ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2014/11/24/3740484/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近お腹の調子悪いから思わず書いちゃったよね。えへへ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これね、見えないけど耳がついてるんだよー。\nお気に入りなの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2014/11/24/3740484/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これもお耳ついてるんだよ〜❤️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お耳day。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうねえこの間のノギビンゴの輩についてと、\nそれから昨日の乃木どこにてバナナマンさんに命名されたジョンソンについて。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これしか話題に上がってない気がするよ今日。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンのみんなもジョンソンって言いたいだけみたいになってる。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全くしょうがないんだから❤️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、さゆにゃんの生誕とじゅんなの生誕に参加させていただいた！！(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2014/11/24/3740484/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなおめでとう❤️❤️❤️\nさゆにゃんは花かんむりの似合う女の子だね。いと可愛い。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみも今度花かんむり被りたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2014/11/24/3740484/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まにむらさん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よく私たちチップとデールみたいって言われる。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2014/11/24/3740484/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみたむ爆笑。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2014/11/24/3740484/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どーもー。ジョンソン＆まにむらでーす。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"え...？結構ジョンソン気に入ってるじゃんって？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うん、なんだか愛着がわいてきた。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2014/11/24/3740484/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちーちゃん久しぶりに会えた。\n嬉しすぎてこの笑顔。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして今日あみに会いにきてくれた皆様本当にありがとう❤️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何人かは次会えるの来年って方もいてとっても寂しいけど、いつでも遊びにきてね(#^.^#)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日、FM-FUJI「沈黙の金曜日」特別版として公開生放送「沈黙の日曜日 in 富士急ハイランド」が開催されました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブの曲数自体は3曲と少なかったんだけど、アルコ＆ピースさんとのトークはめちゃ楽しかった(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱ芸人さん好きだな〜！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それじゃあ明日も朝めちゃ早いので\n失礼しまーす。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、今日のノギビンゴ観てね〜。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じょじょじょ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2014/11/24/3740484/0007.jpeg","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}